  "summary": "The Sinking City 2 updates and DLC roadmap as of 18 Aug 2026 has exactly one confirmed Premium-exclusive side mission: Holloway Manor. No further DLC is announced beyond Holloway Manor. The gold-master build was confirmed on 7 Aug 2026 ahea",
